  "label": "Food Metaphor in Antisemitism",
  "description": "The use of food-related metaphors (like 'jew jerky') to describe Jewish people is a common antisemitic trope. It reduces Jewish identity to a consumable object, reinforcing dehumanization and portraying Jewish people as undesirable or inferior.",
